      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so are you saying the stock is technically \"limited\" right now because the shipment isn't processed, or are we just telling customers that to make the timer work? \n\ni'm just worried if anyone checks the real-time inventory or if the shipment gets logged early, it'll look like we're lying about the scarcity. should we be more transparent about the shipment arrival, or is the timer better if we keep the actual numbers vague?",
