      "content": "We're being completely transparent about the shipment arrival, and I've already spoken to the logistics team to confirm that the bulk shipment is indeed on its way. We're just using the countdown timer to create a sense of excitement and anticipation, rather than to mislead customers. The real-time inventory will be updated as soon as the shipment is processed, and we'll make sure to communicate that to our customers. The timer is more about building hype than deceiving anyone.",
